5. PCAP — HTTP
======================================================================

Все HTTP requests:

tshark -r capture.pcap \
-Y "http.request" \
-T fields \
-e frame.time \
-e ip.src \
-e ip.dst \
-e http.host \
-e http.request.method \
-e http.request.uri \
-e http.user_agent


Только POST:

tshark -r capture.pcap \
-Y 'http.request.method == "POST"' \
-V


Ищем:

- username
- password
- token
- cookie
- upload
- download
- command
- подозрительный User-Agent
- подозрительные URI
- webshell


Полезный фильтр:

http.request.method == "POST"

http.request.uri contains "login"

http.request.uri contains "upload"


