7. TCP STREAM
======================================================================

Получаем список stream:

tshark -r capture.pcap \
-Y tcp \
-T fields \
-e tcp.stream \
-e ip.src \
-e tcp.srcport \
-e ip.dst \
-e tcp.dstport | sort -u


Посмотреть stream №5:

tshark -r capture.pcap \
-q -z follow,tcp,ascii,5


В Wireshark:

ПКМ по пакету
→ Follow
→ TCP Stream


Сохраняем stream:

tshark -r capture.pcap \
-Y "tcp.stream == 5" \
-w work/stream5.pcap


Если обнаружили HTTP:

Wireshark
→ File
→ Export Objects
→ HTTP


После извлечения:

file exports/file.bin

sha256sum exports/file.bin

strings -a -n 6 exports/file.bin


